---
import ThreeBackground from '../../components/ThreeBackground';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>博客 - Eric Cao</title>
  <meta name="description" content="分享我的思考和技术文章">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .page-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .page-description {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .blog-posts {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .blog-post-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      display: block;
    }

    .blog-post-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
    }

    .blog-post-card:hover .post-title {
      color: #667eea;
    }

    .post-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .post-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .post-excerpt {
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .read-more {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      color: #667eea;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .read-more:hover {
      color: #764ba2;
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .back-home {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .back-home:hover {
      color: #667eea;
      transform: translateX(-4px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .container {
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .blog-post-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .post-meta {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <ThreeBackground client:load />

  <div class="container">
    <a href="/" class="back-home">
      ← 回到首页
    </a>

    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">博客</h1>
      <p class="page-description">分享我的思考和技术文章</p>
    </header>

    <main class="blog-posts">
      <div class="blog-post-card">
        <h3 class="post-title">Python 开发工具与最佳实践</h3>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>即将发布</time>
        </div>
        <p class="post-excerpt">分享我在 Python 开发中使用的工具和最佳实践，包括 pip 镜像管理、虚拟环境配置、代码质量工具等。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blog-post-card">
        <h3 class="post-title">构建分布式系统的经验</h3>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>即将发布</time>
        </div>
        <p class="post-excerpt">从航班订票系统项目中学到的分布式系统设计经验，包括 RESTful API 设计、服务间通信、数据一致性等。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blog-post-card">
        <h3 class="post-title">开源项目维护心得</h3>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>即将发布</time>
        </div>
        <p class="post-excerpt">维护 airflow-extended-api-plugin 和 cnpip 等开源项目的经验分享，包括如何处理 issue、PR 审查、版本发布等。</p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
